{"id":"eea5e0ec59b224dc","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/094_Peano_算术_PA.md","title":"094 Peano 算术 PA","display":"094_Peano_算术_PA","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-一阶算术符号\">1. 一阶算术符号</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>，变量集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Var=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(Var=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Var)=\\{X\\subseteq Var:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to Var\\ X=\\{e(i):i&lt;n\\}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Var)=\\{X\\subseteq Var:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to Var\\ X=\\{e(i):i&lt;n\\}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>以及新变量函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"fresh:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Var)\\to Var,\n\\qquad\nfresh(X)=v_{\\min\\{i:v_i\\notin X\\}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[fresh:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Var)\\to Var,\n\\qquad\nfresh(X)=v_{\\min\\{i:v_i\\notin X\\}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>项构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"var,zero,succ,add,mul\">\\(var,zero,succ,add,mul\\)</span>。公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"eq,\\quad neg,\\quad imp,\\quad all.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[eq,\\quad neg,\\quad imp,\\quad all.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-项、公式和结构操作\">2. 项、公式和结构操作</h1>\n<p>项集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Tm_{PA}\">\\(Tm_{PA}\\)</span> 是满足下列闭包条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in Var\">\\(x\\in Var\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"var(x)\\in Tm_{PA}\">\\(var(x)\\in Tm_{PA}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"zero\\in Tm_{PA}\">\\(zero\\in Tm_{PA}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in Tm_{PA}\">\\(t\\in Tm_{PA}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"succ(t)\\in Tm_{PA}\">\\(succ(t)\\in Tm_{PA}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in Tm_{PA}\">\\(s,t\\in Tm_{PA}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"add(s,t)\\in Tm_{PA}\">\\(add(s,t)\\in Tm_{PA}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in Tm_{PA}\">\\(s,t\\in Tm_{PA}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"mul(s,t)\\in Tm_{PA}\">\\(mul(s,t)\\in Tm_{PA}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>公式集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Frm_{PA}\">\\(Frm_{PA}\\)</span> 是满足下列闭包条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in Tm_{PA}\">\\(s,t\\in Tm_{PA}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"eq(s,t)\\in Frm_{PA}\">\\(eq(s,t)\\in Frm_{PA}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in Frm_{PA}\">\\(A\\in Frm_{PA}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"neg(A)\\in Frm_{PA}\">\\(neg(A)\\in Frm_{PA}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in Frm_{PA}\">\\(A,B\\in Frm_{PA}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"imp(A,B)\\in Frm_{PA}\">\\(imp(A,B)\\in Frm_{PA}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in Var\">\\(x\\in Var\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in Frm_{PA}\">\\(A\\in Frm_{PA}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"all(x,A)\\in Frm_{PA}\">\\(all(x,A)\\in Frm_{PA}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_T^{PA}:Tm_{PA}\\to\\mathcal P(Var),\n\\qquad\nFV_F^{PA}:Frm_{PA}\\to\\mathcal P(Var).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_T^{PA}:Tm_{PA}\\to\\mathcal P(Var),\n\\qquad\nFV_F^{PA}:Frm_{PA}\\to\\mathcal P(Var).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本文件中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"FV_T\">\\(FV_T\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"FV_T^{PA}\">\\(FV_T^{PA}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"FV_F\">\\(FV_F\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"FV_F^{PA}\">\\(FV_F^{PA}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>自由变量函数满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_T(var(x))=\\{x\\},\\quad FV_T(zero)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_T(var(x))=\\{x\\},\\quad FV_T(zero)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_T(succ(t))=FV_T(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_T(succ(t))=FV_T(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_T(add(s,t))=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t),\n\\quad\nFV_T(mul(s,t))=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_T(add(s,t))=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t),\n\\quad\nFV_T(mul(s,t))=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_F(eq(s,t))=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_F(eq(s,t))=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_F(neg(A))=FV_F(A),\n\\quad\nFV_F(imp(A,B))=FV_F(A)\\cup FV_F(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_F(neg(A))=FV_F(A),\n\\quad\nFV_F(imp(A,B))=FV_F(A)\\cup FV_F(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_F(all(x,A))=FV_F(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_F(all(x,A))=FV_F(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"BV_F^{PA}:Frm_{PA}\\to\\mathcal P(Var)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[BV_F^{PA}:Frm_{PA}\\to\\mathcal P(Var)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"BV_F^{PA}(eq(s,t))=\\varnothing,\\quad\nBV_F^{PA}(neg(A))=BV_F^{PA}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[BV_F^{PA}(eq(s,t))=\\varnothing,\\quad\nBV_F^{PA}(neg(A))=BV_F^{PA}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"BV_F^{PA}(imp(A,B))=BV_F^{PA}(A)\\cup BV_F^{PA}(B),\n\\quad\nBV_F^{PA}(all(x,A))=BV_F^{PA}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[BV_F^{PA}(imp(A,B))=BV_F^{PA}(A)\\cup BV_F^{PA}(B),\n\\quad\nBV_F^{PA}(all(x,A))=BV_F^{PA}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义替换算子</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Sub_T^{PA}:Tm_{PA}\\times Var\\times Tm_{PA}\\to Tm_{PA},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Sub_T^{PA}:Tm_{PA}\\times Var\\times Tm_{PA}\\to Tm_{PA},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Sub_F^{PA}:Frm_{PA}\\times Var\\times Tm_{PA}\\to Frm_{PA}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Sub_F^{PA}:Frm_{PA}\\times Var\\times Tm_{PA}\\to Frm_{PA}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t[x:=s]\">\\(t[x:=s]\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Sub_T^{PA}(t,x,s)\">\\(Sub_T^{PA}(t,x,s)\\)</span>，记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[x:=s]\">\\(A[x:=s]\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Sub_F^{PA}(A,x,s)\">\\(Sub_F^{PA}(A,x,s)\\)</span>。它们由下列构造子条款给出：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"var(y)[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\ns,&amp;y=x,\\\\\nvar(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[var(y)[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\ns,&amp;y=x,\\\\\nvar(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"zero[x:=s]=zero,\\quad succ(t)[x:=s]=succ(t[x:=s]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[zero[x:=s]=zero,\\quad succ(t)[x:=s]=succ(t[x:=s]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"add(t,u)[x:=s]=add(t[x:=s],u[x:=s]),\n\\quad\nmul(t,u)[x:=s]=mul(t[x:=s],u[x:=s]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[add(t,u)[x:=s]=add(t[x:=s],u[x:=s]),\n\\quad\nmul(t,u)[x:=s]=mul(t[x:=s],u[x:=s]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"eq(t,u)[x:=s]=eq(t[x:=s],u[x:=s]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[eq(t,u)[x:=s]=eq(t[x:=s],u[x:=s]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"neg(A)[x:=s]=neg(A[x:=s]),\n\\quad\nimp(A,B)[x:=s]=imp(A[x:=s],B[x:=s]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[neg(A)[x:=s]=neg(A[x:=s]),\n\\quad\nimp(A,B)[x:=s]=imp(A[x:=s],B[x:=s]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=all(y,A)\">\\(C=all(y,A)\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\nC,&amp;y=x,\\\\\nall(y,A[x:=s]),&amp;y\\ne x,\\ y\\notin FV_T(s),\\\\\nall(z,(A[y:=var(z)])[x:=s]),&amp;y\\ne x,\\ y\\in FV_T(s),\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\nC,&amp;y=x,\\\\\nall(y,A[x:=s]),&amp;y\\ne x,\\ y\\notin FV_T(s),\\\\\nall(z,(A[y:=var(z)])[x:=s]),&amp;y\\ne x,\\ y\\in FV_T(s),\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z=fresh(FV_F(A)\\cup FV_T(s)\\cup\\{x,y\\})\">\\(z=fresh(FV_F(A)\\cup FV_T(s)\\cup\\{x,y\\})\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^{PA}\\subseteq Frm_{PA}\\times Frm_{PA}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_\\alpha^{PA}\\subseteq Frm_{PA}\\times Frm_{PA}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为所有满足下列条件的关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 的交：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Frm_{PA}\">\\(Frm_{PA}\\)</span> 上的等价关系。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,B)\\in E\">\\((A,B)\\in E\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(neg(A),neg(B))\\in E\">\\((neg(A),neg(B))\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_0,B_0),(A_1,B_1)\\in E\">\\((A_0,B_0),(A_1,B_1)\\in E\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(imp(A_0,A_1),imp(B_0,B_1))\\in E\">\\((imp(A_0,A_1),imp(B_0,B_1))\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,B)\\in E\">\\((A,B)\\in E\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in Var\">\\(x\\in Var\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(all(x,A),all(x,B))\\in E\">\\((all(x,A),all(x,B))\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in Var\">\\(x,y\\in Var\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\notin FV_F(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\">\\(y\\notin FV_F(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\\)</span>，则</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(all(x,A),all(y,A[x:=var(y)])\\bigr)\\in E.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(all(x,A),all(y,A[x:=var(y)])\\bigr)\\in E.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>等词原子只按字面相等进入该兼容闭包。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-逻辑与等词公理\">3. 逻辑与等词公理</h1>\n<p>逻辑公理集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Ax_{log}^{PA}\">\\(Ax_{log}^{PA}\\)</span> 是以下七类集合的并：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{\\to1}^{PA}=\\{imp(A,imp(B,A)):A,B\\in Frm_{PA}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{\\to1}^{PA}=\\{imp(A,imp(B,A)):A,B\\in Frm_{PA}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{\\to2}^{PA}\n=\n\\{imp(imp(A,imp(B,C)),imp(imp(A,B),imp(A,C))):A,B,C\\in Frm_{PA}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{\\to2}^{PA}\n=\n\\{imp(imp(A,imp(B,C)),imp(imp(A,B),imp(A,C))):A,B,C\\in Frm_{PA}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{\\to3}^{PA}\n=\n\\{imp(imp(neg(A),neg(B)),imp(B,A)):A,B\\in Frm_{PA}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{\\to3}^{PA}\n=\n\\{imp(imp(neg(A),neg(B)),imp(B,A)):A,B\\in Frm_{PA}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{\\forall1}^{PA}\n=\n\\{imp(all(x,A),A[x:=t]):x\\in Var,A\\in Frm_{PA},t\\in Tm_{PA}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{\\forall1}^{PA}\n=\n\\{imp(all(x,A),A[x:=t]):x\\in Var,A\\in Frm_{PA},t\\in Tm_{PA}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{\\forall2}^{PA}\n=\n\\{imp(all(x,imp(A,B)),imp(A,all(x,B))):x\\in Var,A,B\\in Frm_{PA},x\\notin FV_F(A)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{\\forall2}^{PA}\n=\n\\{imp(all(x,imp(A,B)),imp(A,all(x,B))):x\\in Var,A,B\\in Frm_{PA},x\\notin FV_F(A)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{=1}^{PA}=\\{eq(t,t):t\\in Tm_{PA}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{=1}^{PA}=\\{eq(t,t):t\\in Tm_{PA}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{=2}^{PA}\n=\n\\{imp(eq(t,u),imp(A[x:=t],A[x:=u])):x\\in Var,A\\in Frm_{PA},t,u\\in Tm_{PA}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{=2}^{PA}\n=\n\\{imp(eq(t,u),imp(A[x:=t],A[x:=u])):x\\in Var,A\\in Frm_{PA},t,u\\in Tm_{PA}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{log}^{PA}\n=\nAx_{\\to1}^{PA}\\cup Ax_{\\to2}^{PA}\\cup Ax_{\\to3}^{PA}\n\\cup Ax_{\\forall1}^{PA}\\cup Ax_{\\forall2}^{PA}\n\\cup Ax_{=1}^{PA}\\cup Ax_{=2}^{PA}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{log}^{PA}\n=\nAx_{\\to1}^{PA}\\cup Ax_{\\to2}^{PA}\\cup Ax_{\\to3}^{PA}\n\\cup Ax_{\\forall1}^{PA}\\cup Ax_{\\forall2}^{PA}\n\\cup Ax_{=1}^{PA}\\cup Ax_{=2}^{PA}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-Peano-基本算术公理\">4. Peano 基本算术公理</h1>\n<p>基本算术公理集合定义为下列六个闭公式组成的有限集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nAx_{PA}^{basic}=\\{\\;&amp;\nall(x,neg(eq(succ(var(x)),zero))),\\\\\n&amp;all(x,all(y,imp(eq(succ(var(x)),succ(var(y))),eq(var(x),var(y))))),\\\\\n&amp;all(x,eq(add(var(x),zero),var(x))),\\\\\n&amp;all(x,all(y,eq(add(var(x),succ(var(y))),succ(add(var(x),var(y)))))),\\\\\n&amp;all(x,eq(mul(var(x),zero),zero)),\\\\\n&amp;all(x,all(y,eq(mul(var(x),succ(var(y))),add(mul(var(x),var(y)),var(x)))))\n\\;\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nAx_{PA}^{basic}=\\{\\;&amp;\nall(x,neg(eq(succ(var(x)),zero))),\\\\\n&amp;all(x,all(y,imp(eq(succ(var(x)),succ(var(y))),eq(var(x),var(y))))),\\\\\n&amp;all(x,eq(add(var(x),zero),var(x))),\\\\\n&amp;all(x,all(y,eq(add(var(x),succ(var(y))),succ(add(var(x),var(y)))))),\\\\\n&amp;all(x,eq(mul(var(x),zero),zero)),\\\\\n&amp;all(x,all(y,eq(mul(var(x),succ(var(y))),add(mul(var(x),var(y)),var(x)))))\n\\;\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-归纳公理集合\">5. 归纳公理集合</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in Frm_{PA}\">\\(A\\in Frm_{PA}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in Var\">\\(x\\in Var\\)</span>，归纳公式为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ind(A,x)\n=\nimp(\nA[x:=zero],\nimp(\nall(x,imp(A,A[x:=succ(var(x))])),\nall(x,A)\n)\n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ind(A,x)\n=\nimp(\nA[x:=zero],\nimp(\nall(x,imp(A,A[x:=succ(var(x))])),\nall(x,A)\n)\n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>归纳公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{PA}^{ind}=\\{Ind(A,x):A\\in Frm_{PA},x\\in Var\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{PA}^{ind}=\\{Ind(A,x):A\\in Frm_{PA},x\\in Var\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>全体公理为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{PA}=Ax_{log}^{PA}\\cup Ax_{PA}^{basic}\\cup Ax_{PA}^{ind}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{PA}=Ax_{log}^{PA}\\cup Ax_{PA}^{basic}\\cup Ax_{PA}^{ind}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>PA 的目标差异由全公式归纳族形式化：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{PA}^{ind}\n=\n\\{Ind(A,x):A\\in Frm_{PA},x\\in Var\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{PA}^{ind}\n=\n\\{Ind(A,x):A\\in Frm_{PA},x\\in Var\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{PA}^{ind}\\subseteq Ax_{PA}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{PA}^{ind}\\subseteq Ax_{PA}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-规则关系\">6. 规则关系</h1>\n<p>规则显示为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\forall x\\,A},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{B}\\ (A\\equiv_\\alpha^{PA}B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\forall x\\,A},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{B}\\ (A\\equiv_\\alpha^{PA}B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>相应规则关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_\\to^{PA}=\\{((A,imp(A,B)),B):A,B\\in Frm_{PA}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_\\to^{PA}=\\{((A,imp(A,B)),B):A,B\\in Frm_{PA}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_\\forall^{PA}=\\{((A),all(x,A)):A\\in Frm_{PA},x\\in Var\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_\\forall^{PA}=\\{((A),all(x,A)):A\\in Frm_{PA},x\\in Var\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_\\alpha^{PA}=\\{((A),B):A,B\\in Frm_{PA},\\ A\\equiv_\\alpha^{PA}B\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_\\alpha^{PA}=\\{((A),B):A,B\\in Frm_{PA},\\ A\\equiv_\\alpha^{PA}B\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq Frm_{PA}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq Frm_{PA}\\)</span> 出发的 PA 证明是非空有限公式序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\">\\((A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\\)</span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 满足下列条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in Ax_{PA}\">\\(A_i\\in Ax_{PA}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in Rule_\\to^{PA}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in Rule_\\to^{PA}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in Var\">\\(x\\in Var\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=all(x,A_j)\">\\(A_i=all(x,A_j)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\bigcup_{B\\in\\Gamma}FV_F(B)\">\\(x\\notin\\bigcup_{B\\in\\Gamma}FV_F(B)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in Rule_\\alpha^{PA}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in Rule_\\alpha^{PA}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Proof_{PA}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Proof_{PA}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq Frm_{PA}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq Frm_{PA}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\">\\(\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\\)</span> 是上一节意义下的非空有限 PA 证明，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{m-1}=A\">\\(A_{m-1}=A\\)</span>。归纳公理行必须满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in Ax_{PA}^{ind}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists B\\in Frm_{PA}\\,\\exists x\\in Var\\;\nA_i=Ind(B,x),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A_i\\in Ax_{PA}^{ind}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists B\\in Frm_{PA}\\,\\exists x\\in Var\\;\nA_i=Ind(B,x),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Ind(B,x)\">\\(Ind(B,x)\\)</span> 是第 5 节定义的公式生成函数；规则行必须通过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Rule_\\to^{PA}\">\\(Rule_\\to^{PA}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Rule_\\forall^{PA}\">\\(Rule_\\forall^{PA}\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Rule_\\alpha^{PA}\">\\(Rule_\\alpha^{PA}\\)</span> 三个本地关系检查。</p>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{PA}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{PA}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Proof_{PA}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\">\\(Proof_{PA}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-整个形式系统\">9. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{PA}\n=\n\\bigl(\nVar,\nTm_{PA},\nFrm_{PA},\nFV_T,\nFV_F,\nBV_F^{PA},\nfresh,\nSub_T^{PA},\nSub_F^{PA},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{PA},\nAx_{PA}^{basic},\nAx_{PA}^{ind},\nAx_{PA},\nRule_\\to^{PA},\nRule_\\forall^{PA},\nRule_\\alpha^{PA},\nProof_{PA},\n\\vdash_{PA}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{PA}\n=\n\\bigl(\nVar,\nTm_{PA},\nFrm_{PA},\nFV_T,\nFV_F,\nBV_F^{PA},\nfresh,\nSub_T^{PA},\nSub_F^{PA},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{PA},\nAx_{PA}^{basic},\nAx_{PA}^{ind},\nAx_{PA},\nRule_\\to^{PA},\nRule_\\forall^{PA},\nRule_\\alpha^{PA},\nProof_{PA},\n\\vdash_{PA}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含一阶 Peano 算术的基本算术公理、全公式归纳公理集合和 Hilbert 证明；不含二阶量词、真算术公理或外部模型论构造。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-一阶算术符号","text":"1. 一阶算术符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-项、公式和结构操作","text":"2. 项、公式和结构操作","level":1},{"id":"3.-逻辑与等词公理","text":"3. 逻辑与等词公理","level":1},{"id":"4.-Peano-基本算术公理","text":"4. Peano 基本算术公理","level":1},{"id":"5.-归纳公理集合","text":"5. 归纳公理集合","level":1},{"id":"6.-规则关系","text":"6. 规则关系","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可证性","text":"8. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"9.-整个形式系统","text":"9. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"Var=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Var)=\\{X\\subseteq Var:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to Var\\ X=\\{e(i):i<n\\}\\},","display":true},{"tex":"fresh:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Var)\\to Var,\n\\qquad\nfresh(X)=v_{\\min\\{i:v_i\\notin X\\}}.","display":true},{"tex":"var,zero,succ,add,mul","display":false},{"tex":"eq,\\quad neg,\\quad imp,\\quad all.","display":true},{"tex":"Tm_{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in Var","display":false},{"tex":"var(x)\\in Tm_{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"zero\\in Tm_{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in Tm_{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"succ(t)\\in Tm_{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in Tm_{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"add(s,t)\\in Tm_{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in Tm_{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"mul(s,t)\\in Tm_{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"Frm_{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in Tm_{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"eq(s,t)\\in Frm_{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in Frm_{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"neg(A)\\in Frm_{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in Frm_{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"imp(A,B)\\in Frm_{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in Var","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in Frm_{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"all(x,A)\\in Frm_{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"FV_T^{PA}:Tm_{PA}\\to\\mathcal P(Var),\n\\qquad\nFV_F^{PA}:Frm_{PA}\\to\\mathcal P(Var).","display":true},{"tex":"FV_T","display":false},{"tex":"FV_T^{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"FV_F","display":false},{"tex":"FV_F^{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"FV_T(var(x))=\\{x\\},\\quad FV_T(zero)=\\varnothing,","display":true},{"tex":"FV_T(succ(t))=FV_T(t),","display":true},{"tex":"FV_T(add(s,t))=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t),\n\\quad\nFV_T(mul(s,t))=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t),","display":true},{"tex":"FV_F(eq(s,t))=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t),","display":true},{"tex":"FV_F(neg(A))=FV_F(A),\n\\quad\nFV_F(imp(A,B))=FV_F(A)\\cup FV_F(B),","display":true},{"tex":"FV_F(all(x,A))=FV_F(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"BV_F^{PA}:Frm_{PA}\\to\\mathcal P(Var)","display":true},{"tex":"BV_F^{PA}(eq(s,t))=\\varnothing,\\quad\nBV_F^{PA}(neg(A))=BV_F^{PA}(A),","display":true},{"tex":"BV_F^{PA}(imp(A,B))=BV_F^{PA}(A)\\cup BV_F^{PA}(B),\n\\quad\nBV_F^{PA}(all(x,A))=BV_F^{PA}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"Sub_T^{PA}:Tm_{PA}\\times Var\\times Tm_{PA}\\to Tm_{PA},","display":true},{"tex":"Sub_F^{PA}:Frm_{PA}\\times Var\\times Tm_{PA}\\to Frm_{PA}.","display":true},{"tex":"t[x:=s]","display":false},{"tex":"Sub_T^{PA}(t,x,s)","display":false},{"tex":"A[x:=s]","display":false},{"tex":"Sub_F^{PA}(A,x,s)","display":false},{"tex":"var(y)[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\ns,&y=x,\\\\\nvar(y),&y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"zero[x:=s]=zero,\\quad succ(t)[x:=s]=succ(t[x:=s]),","display":true},{"tex":"add(t,u)[x:=s]=add(t[x:=s],u[x:=s]),\n\\quad\nmul(t,u)[x:=s]=mul(t[x:=s],u[x:=s]),","display":true},{"tex":"eq(t,u)[x:=s]=eq(t[x:=s],u[x:=s]),","display":true},{"tex":"neg(A)[x:=s]=neg(A[x:=s]),\n\\quad\nimp(A,B)[x:=s]=imp(A[x:=s],B[x:=s]).","display":true},{"tex":"C=all(y,A)","display":false},{"tex":"C[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\nC,&y=x,\\\\\nall(y,A[x:=s]),&y\\ne x,\\ y\\notin FV_T(s),\\\\\nall(z,(A[y:=var(z)])[x:=s]),&y\\ne x,\\ y\\in FV_T(s),\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"z=fresh(FV_F(A)\\cup FV_T(s)\\cup\\{x,y\\})","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_\\alpha^{PA}\\subseteq Frm_{PA}\\times Frm_{PA}","display":true},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"Frm_{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"(A,B)\\in E","display":false},{"tex":"(neg(A),neg(B))\\in E","display":false},{"tex":"(A_0,B_0),(A_1,B_1)\\in E","display":false},{"tex":"(imp(A_0,A_1),imp(B_0,B_1))\\in E","display"